+\f[B]\-h\f[R], \f[B]\-\-help\f[R]
+Show common options and quit.
+.TP
+\f[B]\-r\f[R], \f[B]\-\-retry\f[R]
+Retry if output file exists.
+.TP
+\f[B]\-d\f[R] \f[I]DIR\f[R], \f[B]\-\-dir\f[R]=\f[I]DIR\f[R]
